{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07794","headline":"卢明府早秋宴张郎中海园即事得秋字 · 孟浩然","name":"卢明府早秋宴张郎中海园即事得秋字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邑有弦歌宰，翔鸾狎野鸥。\n眷言华省旧，暂拂海池游。\n郁岛藏深竹，前溪对舞楼。\n更闻书即事，云物是清秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07794.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07794","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}